 <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title"><div class="hero-copy"><h1 id="hero-title">Quantum computation through subsystem spin</h1><p class="hero-intro">Despite enormous research into quantum computation, I feel that we still do not understand these machines very well. I propose <em>subsystem spin</em> as a new way of thinking about how quantum computation works.</p><div class="hero-meta"><span>Curated by Kunal Marwaha</span><span>A perspective &amp; research agenda</span></div><p class="last-updated">Last updated <time datetime={lastUpdated}>{lastUpdatedLabel}</time></p></div><PathPlate/></section>
